	"_comment": [
		"Hand-written Basque for the strings HikaShop has no word for. Merged over the ones taken from",
		"HikaShop's own eu-ES file by tools/build-locales.mjs, so regenerating keeps these.",
		"Basque counts in two, and the plural is a suffixed article: produktua is the product,",
		"produktuak the products, so a count reads 5 aldaera and the noun carries no separate word.",
		"It is related to nothing else here, so nothing about the Spanish or French around it applies:",
		"the case endings do the work that prepositions do elsewhere (dendan, in the shop)."
	],
